---
title: "Gateway Quickstart"
description: "Start the QQL Connect RPC gateway in basic, authenticated, and full policy modes."
sidebar:
  order: 2
---

## 1. Basic Gateway (No Auth)

{% terminal title="Start basic gateway" %}
qql-go serve --qdrant-url http://localhost:6334
{% /terminal %}

Transparent QQL proxy. Any query passes through.

Test it:

{% terminal title="Test with curl" %}
curl -X POST http://localhost:50051/qql.QQL/Exec \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"query": "SHOW COLLECTIONS"}'
{% /terminal %}

Health check:

{% terminal title="Health check" %}
curl http://localhost:50051/health
# {"ok":true,"version":"X.Y.Z"}
{% /terminal %}

---

## 2. With JWT Auth (No Policy)

{% terminal title="Start gateway with JWT auth" %}
qql-go serve \
  --qdrant-url http://localhost:6334 \
  --jwks-url https://idp.example.com/.well-known/jwks.json \
  --jwt-issuer https://idp.example.com \
  --jwt-audience my-app \
  --tenant-claim org_id \
  --role-claim role
{% /terminal %}

{% aside type="note" title="No Policy" %}
Validates tokens but doesn't enforce policy — all authenticated users can do everything.
{% /aside %}

---

## 3. Full Gateway (Auth + Policy + Audit)

{% terminal title="Start full gateway" %}
qql-go serve \
  --qdrant-url http://localhost:6334 \
  --jwks-url https://idp.example.com/.well-known/jwks.json \
  --jwt-issuer https://idp.example.com \
  --jwt-audience my-app \
  --tenant-claim org_id \
  --role-claim role \
  --policy-file policies.yaml \
  --policy-reload \
  --audit \
  --audit-file audit.jsonl \
  --rate-limit 100 \
  --rate-limit-capacity 20
{% /terminal %}

---

## 4. With Embeddings (Local Inference)

{% terminal title="Start gateway with embeddings" %}
qql-go serve \
  --qdrant-url http://localhost:6334 \
  --inference-mode local \
  --embedding-endpoint http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1/embeddings \
  --embedding-model text-embedding-all-minilm-l6-v2-embedding \
  --embedding-dimension 384
{% /terminal %}

---

## 5. From Go

```go
import (
    "github.com/srimon12/qql-go/server"
    "github.com/srimon12/qql-go/internal/config"
)

server.Run(server.Config{
    ListenAddr: ":50051",
    QdrantURL:  "http://localhost:6334",
    QQLConfig:  &config.Config{InferenceMode: "cloud"},
    Gateway: &server.GatewayConfig{
        JWTValidator: server.NewJWTValidator(server.JWKSConfig{
            JWKSURL: "https://idp.example.com/.well-known/jwks.json",
        }),
        PolicyEngine: pe,
        Audit:        server.NewAuditLogger(nil, true),
    },
})
```

---

## Default Port

The gateway listens on `:50051` by default. Change with `--listen`:

{% terminal title="Custom port" %}
qql-go serve --listen :8080 --qdrant-url http://localhost:6334
{% /terminal %}
